                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so, dass man es nicht falsifizieren kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "100f28fe-43d4-4d48-9f38-3b22c9b3b3d3",
                                                "sense_id": "53bb0e74-0b33-367c-9f26-1c759f51ead8",
                                                "text": "Wissenschaftliche Thesen dürfen nicht unwiderlegbar formuliert sein."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "20255c56-e836-4316-838a-9793cc485a73",
                        "source_entry_id": "c1fc0452-d2cf-34d3-bda1-2c968739f5b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "hieb- und stichfest",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hieb- und stichfest",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9a5e026-26cc-316a-8476-e17a938fac50",
                                        "entry_id": "ff970027-2d51-34df-8eb0-6edb10e54f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unwiderlegbar, gegen alle Angriffe geschützt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41f888b3-4af3-4699-bc69-c38ca2a2f189",
                                                "sense_id": "f9a5e026-26cc-316a-8476-e17a938fac50",
                                                "text": "Der Vertrag, den du ausgearbeitet hast, ist hieb- und stichfest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dca91851-1611-46ef-a2e0-627f276e147b",
                                                "sense_id": "f9a5e026-26cc-316a-8476-e17a938fac50",
                                                "text": "Diese Beweise sind hieb- und stichfest, die Staatsanwaltschaft wird den Angeklagten hinter Gitter bringen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ed9e9ee1-2a09-4404-a87a-831e48f08bf8",
                        "source_entry_id": "c1fc0452-d2cf-34d3-bda1-2c968739f5b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "irrefutable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irrefutable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                        "entry_id": "4a026a68-4259-3276-ab93-c2ecb6fb506a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "undeniable; unable to be disproved or refuted"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27e216e1-b041-49c6-8ec8-5daaeb5c4bad",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "[…]clear and irrefutable evidence of the Cause I have undertaken"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22d11d16-3a39-4cc3-8553-bb1ed53b57a1",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "True, there had been nothing, in his lifetime, viler than this man. She knew it, there was no other fact within her consciousness that she felt to be so certain; and yet, because her persecutor found himself safe and irrefutable in death, he frowned upon his victim, and threw back the blame on her!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "661b1623-5db3-475d-81ec-44b1d28f8b89",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "He had formed his mind by Helvetius, whose system he deemed irrefutable, and in whom alone he had faith."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ff410fa-3106-472b-8ec3-cdb1a4b938d5",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "I have listened also to the remarks of counsel, with high interest—and especially will I commend the masterly and irrefutable logic of the distinguished gentleman who represents the plaintiff. But gentlemen, let us beware how we allow mere human testimony, human ingenuity in argument and human ideas of equity, to influence us at a moment so solemn as this."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a81e4c83-7eb4-4a08-acb9-81e218fc958e",
                        "source_entry_id": "c1fc0452-d2cf-34d3-bda1-2c968739f5b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "incontrovertible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incontrovertible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52fb2096-e769-3b49-8004-4b0f856e474b",
                                        "entry_id": "7400e879-9795-3305-927a-dce9a0da0f9b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not capable of being denied, challenged, or disputed; closed to questioning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f1faded-56d1-43bc-978c-ff9180c3ce3c",
                                                "sense_id": "52fb2096-e769-3b49-8004-4b0f856e474b",
                                                "text": "incontrovertible evidence"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dd6bc6e-9c85-4f09-a45d-fe25a9d9a52e",
                                                "sense_id": "52fb2096-e769-3b49-8004-4b0f856e474b",
                                                "text": "Her statement that dogs are mammals is incontrovertible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3766491-35c9-4781-b0e4-d78a74d89dfd",
                                                "sense_id": "52fb2096-e769-3b49-8004-4b0f856e474b",
                                                "text": "Just now he was wearing a suit of maple-syrup brown with faint but incontrovertible purple stripes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "929b9dc1-7fe3-4603-bffd-bd4caa85dc0e",
                                                "sense_id": "52fb2096-e769-3b49-8004-4b0f856e474b",
                                                "text": "There is incontrovertible evidence that electrification of itself has great publicity value, but this would be greatly enhanced if the public knew in more detail how it would transform their services."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5c14f2b-9a52-4510-bc49-eec911d70eb6",
                                                "sense_id": "52fb2096-e769-3b49-8004-4b0f856e474b",
                                                "text": "All said that the incontrovertible evidence that climate change has already arrived—in the form of frighteningly extreme wildfires, drought, storms and floods afflicting every corner of the United States—has helped build political support."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64a99d12-4fc7-4430-9336-e5c9bbb1bffb",
                        "source_entry_id": "c1fc0452-d2cf-34d3-bda1-2c968739f5b4",
